aii's history, present, and future with photo stops throughout the tour. Engage along with multiple stops infused with hiking to Manoa Fallas back in Manoa Valley,  Follow your 2-mile total hike with a delicious meal at a local cafe.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "Waikiki Hawaii", "booking_notes": "Meet up @ Kuhio Beach Hula Mound 1:00 pm\nThe activity guide will meet you there with bikes and helmets. \n\nIf you have a question on location. We'll text you the map location via smartphone. \nUber & Lyft good transportation methods.  \n\nOahu Contact Kelly:  808-392-5414 c/t", "cancellation_notes": "Full refund if canceled within 24 hours of your tour start time.", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "4-4.5 Hours • Manoa Falls bike/hike Tour 1:00 pm Daily", "short_description": "Power up with electric stallions to Hawaii's majestic Manoa Falls 12 mile ebike round trip-1.8 mile hike round trip.", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/XQDrl6hHS3e4iO2Kfi12", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/XQDrl6hHS3e4iO2Kfi12", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/biketourhawaii/items/58782/images/399565/", "pk": 399565, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/pmKmuwRgS1e3vtW5ljzx", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/pmKmuwRgS1e3vtW5ljzx", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/biketourhawaii/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/biketourhawaii/items/58782/"}, "crop": {"y": 287, "x": 0, "width": 2560, "url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/dJAD16J0RfOqpF8cnJhh", "height": 1347}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/dJAD16J0RfOqpF8cnJhh", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/dJAD16J0RfOqpF8cnJhh", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/